const rtdal003990Source0004 = "vec_proxy.Period <- function(x, ...) {\n  out <- list(\n    year = x@year,\n    month = x@month,\n    day = x@day,\n    hour = x@hour,\n    minute = x@minute,\n    second = x@.Data\n  )\n\n  # Push names onto the `second` column (i.e. `.Data`) so they get sliced and restored\n  names <- names(x)\n  if (!is.null(names)) {\n    names(out$second) <- names\n  }\n\n  n <- length(out$year)\n\n  vctrs::new_data_frame(out, n = n)\n}"

